{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And it will be the girl.</b> The meaning: the matter will be that the girl to whom I say, etc. — as in ״כי יהיה נערה בתולה״ (when there will be a girl, a virgin)." "<b>And she says, Drink.</b> This is not divination but merely a sign. And he did not rely on the sign to give her the ornaments before asking 'Whose daughter are you?' Rather he prepared them to give to her."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:33.371342321Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}